00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:08.000
that a great way to analyze game

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.780
Stratégic thinking

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:20.110
figure out what their payoffs are

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.870
賽局理論做分析

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.250
第一步是寫清楚每個人想要什麼

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.150
